  "id": "response-schema/a-subschema-whose-type-is-no-single-portable-word-fails-the-turn",
  "title": "A binding's response schema whose subschema gives its type as a list, as null, or as a word outside object, array, string, number, integer and boolean fails the turn before its model is asked",
